abstract: >-
  Kronos Engine is a deterministic, multi-scale counterfactual simulation
  engine for modeling healthcare scenarios across multiple scales of
  resolution. It includes a sentinel adapter for integration with healthcare
  data systems. The engine provides reproducible, traceable simulation
  results to support research and analysis.
